{%- comment -%}
  Mallo Gallery: show the WHOLE product photo everywhere (no cropping).
  Product cards keep one square frame so the grid stays even, and the photo is fitted inside it
  on a soft sand background. Furniture photos are mostly wide room shots, so cropping cut the pieces off.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  product-card .card-gallery,
  product-card .card-gallery .product-media-container,
  product-card .card-gallery slideshow-slide {
    background: #F4EFE7;
  }
  product-card .card-gallery :is(img, .product-media__image) {
    object-fit: contain !important;
    object-position: center !important;
  }
  /* Room tiles (Shop the bedroom / living room): whole photo too */
  .mallo-rooms__media img { object-fit: contain !important; background: #F4EFE7; }
</style>
